POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/items
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=itemBoundary


--itemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="itemName"

유형 없는 물품
--itemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="category"

ETC
--itemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

물품 유형 누락 테스트입니다.
--itemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="location"

테스트 장소
--itemBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="occurredAt"

2026-10-17
--itemBoundary--

